##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A grey floor and back wall under a sphere light shaped by an IES profile, which throws a cone onto the floor
version 3.03
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 8 8
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -30 1 0 0
WorldBegin
# the light faces its +z, turned to face down onto the floor. It is placed in a
# transformation block, since an attribute block would turn it off at its end
TransformBegin
Translate 0 0.5 0
Rotate 90 1 0 0
Scale 0.1 0.1 0.1
Light "PxrSphereLight" "lamp" "float intensity" [5] "string iesProfile" ["data/paths.ies"]
TransformEnd
Color [0.6 0.6 0.6]
Surface "matte"
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 -2  2 -1 -2  2 -1 2  -2 -1 2]
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 1  2 -1 1  2 1.5 1  -2 1.5 1]
WorldEnd
